Package: devjam-archive-keyring-legacy
Version: 1.42-3
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Signing key for the dev-jam apt repository (legacy)
 OpenPGP key that signs the dev-jam apt repository, installed in
 /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d for Debian Live images that still use
 sources.list without Signed-By. Use devjam-archive-keyring on other
 systems; this package will be dropped once Debian Live handles
 deb822 .sources files.
